  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_HEADER.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_1.png\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 新增多種釣竿</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 基礎模組釣竿：鐵製、金製、鑽石製、獄髓製</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 這些釣竿可透過多種方式合成，例如升級物品或直接升級</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 每次升級都需要前一階段的釣竿，且釣竿升級需在鍛造台上進行</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 本模組與許多模組相容，例如 Chaos Awakens 和 Better Fishing Rods</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Better Fishing Rods 為釣竿加入升級系統，而本模組的釣竿也支援該功能</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模組包含大量內容，例如合成配方，可在 Wiki 中查閱</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcursedwarrior.com%252firon-fishing-rods-wiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_4.png\"><br></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><u><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_2.png\"></u></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fishing-rods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Better Fishing Rods - 多項改良，提升釣魚樂趣</span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/book-fishing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Book Fishing - 為釣魚增添大量附魔書</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fchaosawakens.github.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chaos Awakens - 本模組包含該模組金屬製成的多種釣竿</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frevstudios.cf%252fpure-chaos-downloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pure Chaos - 加入該模組材料製成的釣竿</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">（未來將新增更多相容性）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcursed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_PROMO.png\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（建議至少 4GB），使用我的代碼 <strong>Cursed</strong> 即可享有首月 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，快和好友一起遊玩！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加入我的 Discord 聊天同樂！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZUah6a8Dqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Iron_Fishing_Rods/BH_IR_3.png\"></a></span>&nbsp;</p>",
